{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hequan-e-o168","title":"鲂笺六乞速救引彭绮逢龙为鉴","accounts":[{"id":"hequan-a-4a1a66d60e4e01e78064","label":"正文","text":"鲂笺六乞速救引彭绮逢龙为鉴","evidence":["hequan-q-a510140df698fea29532"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0058","role":"笺称归命非复在天正在明使君、见救以往功可必成不时则与王靖等同祸、前彭绮时旌麾在逢龙郡民大小欢喜并思立效、恨去电速东得增众专力讨绮绮始败、愿深察此言","evidence":["hequan-q-a510140df698fea29532"]},{"person":"wendi-p0039","role":"被乞深察者","evidence":["hequan-q-a510140df698fea29532"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["hequan-q-a510140df698fea29532"]},"ordering_evidence":"hequan-q-a510140df698fea29532","source_order":[60,332,0],"order":10653}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0039","name":"曹休","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0058","name":"周鲂","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hequan-q-a510140df698fea29532","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-f18148994d870a5538a5","layer":"original","quote":"今鲂归命，非复在天，正在明使君耳。若见救以往，则功可必成；如见救不时，则与靖等同祸。前彭绮时，闻旌麾在逢龙〖6〗，此郡民大小欢喜，并思立效。若留一月日间〖7〗，事当大成；恨去电速，东得增众专力讨绮，绮始败耳。愿使君深察此言","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":331,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
